Introduction

The Delivery Intelligence Platform (DIP) provides end-to-end operational visibility and control across fleet management, dispatch operations, delivery execution, proof-of-delivery processing, equipment tracking, and real-time driver telemetry.

The platform is designed to support day-to-day logistics operations by enabling dispatch teams to coordinate deliveries while giving drivers the tools required to complete deliveries efficiently and accurately.

The platform consists of two primary applications:

Dispatcher Operations Console

Used by:

Dispatchers
Operations Managers
Fleet Supervisors
Administrators

Primary capabilities:

Fleet visibility
Dispatch coordination
Driver monitoring
Package management
Proof verification
Operational reporting
Driver Mobile Application

Used by:

Delivery Drivers

Primary capabilities:

Route execution
Delivery management
GPS verification
Proof-of-delivery submission
Exception reporting
