Best Practices
For Dispatchers
Monitor dashboard metrics frequently.
Investigate exceptions promptly.
Maintain awareness of driver activity.
Review completed deliveries daily.
Escalate issues early.
For Drivers
Keep GPS enabled.
Submit clear delivery photographs.
Verify location before confirmation.
Report exceptions immediately.
Synchronize delivery data regularly.
Support

